OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with variable cloud and some
OL,7,Fclear intervals. Overnight staying
OL,8,Fmostly dry with clear intervals but
OL,9,Fthe odd shower possible from the
OL,10,Fnorth. Fresh northeasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy at times with bright
OL,13,For sunny spells interspersed with some
OL,14,Fscattered showers from the north.
OL,15,FFresh northeasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
