OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FNortherly
OL,6,Fwinds bring scattered showers mixed
OL,7,Fwith bright spells on Friday, some
OL,8,Fwintry. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,9,Fon Saturday before showers return on
OL,10,FSunday.
